  m_text: '1. Players take turns rolling the dice.



    2. Move your piece according
    to the number rolled.



    3. Collect yellow items to earn points.



    4.
    Watch out for hidden traps! Red tiles remove 2 points.



    5. Collect 10 items
    and reach the finish tile to win.


    Be the first player to reach the finish
    with 10 items!

'
